.SS "discipline bench"
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
Benchmark tooling for the bench\-regression gate
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.PP
\fBdiscipline bench\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.PP
\fBOPTIONS\fR
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SS "discipline bench derive"
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
Derive paired\-ratio noise floors and baseline ratios from repeated same\-commit runs
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.PP
\fBdiscipline bench derive\fR [\fB\-\-baseline\fR] [\fB\-\-allow\-mixed\-commits\fR] [\fB\-\-ceiling\-pct\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIRUNS\fR> 
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.PP
\fBOPTIONS\fR
.TP
\fB\-\-baseline\fR \fI<BASELINE>\fR
Merge the derived platform entry into this ratio baseline file (created if absent)
.TP
\fB\-\-allow\-mixed\-commits\fR
Accept runs of different commits (recorded in the baseline); only when the differences cannot move a number
.TP
\fB\-\-ceiling\-pct\fR \fI<CEILING_PCT>\fR [default: 50]
Derived cell floors above this percentage are reported but not gated
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIRUNS\fR>
`discipline\-bench\-ratio/v1` run files of the same code (at least two)
.SS "discipline doctor"
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
Check that the repository and its platform enforce discipline: workflows, CODEOWNERS, branch protection. Exit 0 = healthy, 1 = a failing check, 2 = could not check
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.PP
\fBdiscipline doctor\fR [\fB\-\-branch\fR] [\fB\-\-repo\fR] [\fB\-\-local\-only\fR] [\fB\-\-strict\fR] [\fB\-f\fR|\fB\-\-format\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.PP
\fBOPTIONS\fR
.TP
\fB\-\-branch\fR \fI<BRANCH>\fR
Branch whose protection is checked (default: the repository\*(Aqs default branch)
.TP
\fB\-\-repo\fR \fI<REPO>\fR
Repository path on the forge, e.g. OWNER/NAME (default: from the CI environment or the `origin` remote; set DISCIPLINE_FORGE for a self\-hosted forge)
.TP
\fB\-\-local\-only\fR
Check only local files; skip the platform API
.TP
\fB\-\-strict\fR
Treat warnings as failures
.TP
\fB\-f\fR, \fB\-\-format\fR \fI<FORMAT>\fR [default: text]
Output format
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
text
.IP \(bu 2
json
.RE
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Every enabled gate passed, or advisory mode is on.
.TP
.B 1
At least one blocking violation.
.TP
.B 2
Could not check: a gate could not run, a tool or input was missing, the configuration
was invalid, or the base ref could not be resolved. Never a pass.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I discipline.toml
Repository configuration; see
.BR discipline.toml (5).
.TP
.I discipline-baseline.toml
Grandfathered findings written by
.BR "discipline baseline \-\-write" .
